        skos:definition  "reversible binding of a substance by <span class=\"sts-tbx-entailedTerm\"><a href=\"https://data.geoscience.earth/ncl/ISO11074v2025/3.448\">soil <span class=\"sts-tbx-entailedTerm-num\">(3.448)</span></a></span> constituents"@en , "liaison réversible d'une substance avec des constituants du <span class=\"sts-tbx-entailedTerm\"><a href=\"https://data.geoscience.earth/ncl/ISO11074v2025/3.448\">sol&nbsp; <span class=\"sts-tbx-entailedTerm-num\">(3.448)</span></a></span>"@fr ;
