        skos:definition  "operational requirements and/or instructions as to how to carry out <span class=\"sts-tbx-entailedTerm\"><a href=\"https://data.geoscience.earth/ncl/ISO11074v2025/3.410\">sampling <span class=\"sts-tbx-entailedTerm-num\">(3.410)</span></a></span>"@en , "exigences et/ou instructions opérationnelles concernant la mise en œuvre de l'<span class=\"sts-tbx-entailedTerm\"><a href=\"https://data.geoscience.earth/ncl/ISO11074v2025/3.410\">échantillonnage&nbsp; <span class=\"sts-tbx-entailedTerm-num\">(3.410)</span></a></span>"@fr ;
